/F1 8.5 Tf
0.200 0.200 0.200 rg
BT 50.00 317.00 Td (1. GLOBAL GEODETIC \(WGS-84\): Latitude, Longitude in degrees \(Earth as an oblate spheroid\).) Tj ET
BT 50.00 303.00 Td (2. PLANETARY CARTESIAN \(ECEF\): Earth-Centered, Earth-Fixed \(X, Y, Z in meters from planetary core\).) Tj ET
