/F2 9.0 Tf
0.100 0.450 0.200 rg
BT 40.00 423.00 Td (- LAYER 1: STRICT METRIC ROOT \(1.0 Unit = 1.0 Meter\). Mandatory for 100% of all assets, meshes, and tools in Scratchbox.) Tj ET
/F2 9.0 Tf
0.100 0.450 0.200 rg
BT 40.00 411.00 Td (- LAYER 2: UNIVERSAL GEOGRAPHIC BRIDGE. An explicit, opt-in component strictly required for geolocated assets.) Tj ET
/F1 8.7 Tf
0.200 0.200 0.200 rg
BT 40.00 399.00 Td (  If an asset has a real-world anchor, it projects into Layer 1 via LocalTangentPlane. If not, it remains in pure metric space.) Tj ET
